====Verb====
{{en-verb}} {{tlb|en|intransitive}}

# To [[withdraw]] from a [[position]], [[go back]].
## To withdraw military forces
##: {{ux|en|The general refused to order his soldiers to '''retreat''', despite being vastly outnumbered.}}
# To [[shrink]] [[back]] due to generally warmer temperatures. {{q|of a glacier}}
# To slope back.
#* {{quote-book|1=en|year=1898|author=w:H.G. Wells|title=w:The War of the Worlds|publisher=William Heinemann|location=London|page=111|passage=His face was a fair weakness, his chin '''retreated''', and his hair lay in crisp, almost flaxen curls on his low forehead; his eyes were rather large, pale blue, and blankly staring.}}
#: {{ux|en|a '''retreating''' forehead}}

